<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Rentals rated strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Rentals rated strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Jennifer Cole initiated coverage of U.S. Rentals Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Cole said in a research note that the stocks's current valuation &quot;significantly undervalues its growth potential.&quot;</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1 per share for 1997 and $1.20 for 1998 versus $0.85 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to 17-7/8.</p>
</text>
